{"id": "section-body-00701", "title": "Cough", "chapterId": "chapter-one", "blocks": [{"id": "body-00701", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Cough", "runs": [{"text": "Cough"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-00702", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Cough is a common reflex action that clears the throat of mucus, allergens, dust or other foreign irritants. A cough can be caused by several conditions, both temporary and permanent. Frequent coughing indicates the presence of a disease.", "runs": [{"text": "Cough is a common reflex action that clears the throat of mucus, allergens, dust or other foreign irritants. A cough can be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "caused by several conditions, both temporary and permanent. Frequent coughing indicates the presence of a disease."}]}, {"id": "body-00703", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Characteristics of cough/sputum", "runs": [{"text": "Characteristics"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cough/sputum"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-00704", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "If cough is dry without sputum and fever, it is probable an allergic condition or mild upper respiratory illness (e.g., allergic rhinitis or allergic bronchitis)", "runs": [{"text": "If cough is dry without sputum and fever, it is probable an allergic condition or mild upper respiratory"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "illness (e.g., allergic rhinitis or allergic bronchitis)"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1867"}}, {"id": "body-00705", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "If cough is dry without sputum or fever and is associated with other congestive symptoms, it may be due to Congestive Cardiac Failure (CCF)", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cough"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "dry"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "without"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sputum"}, {"tex